Miscellaneous Drivers

This directory holds headers for drivers of peripheral ICs that have no
matching generic Zephyr driver class, and whose functionality is specific
to the device rather than to an SoC vendor.

SoC- and vendor-specific functionality does not belong here. See the
Vendor-Specific API Placement Policy
(doc/develop/api/vendor_interfaces_policy.rst): such code goes under
soc/<vendor>/.

Existing subdirectories predate that policy and are retained for
compatibility. Do not add new SoC-vendor-specific headers here.
